","title":"步","time":780156618,"poster":"Noz",]),(["id":15,"title":"HELP START","body":"Often the hardest part of playing a character is getting the character
through the first few levels of experience.  But, after getting going, your
familiarity is usually enough to see you through most future adventures.
The first thing you need to do is become familiar with all of the
commands available to you.
You can type \"help\" to start.
Experimenting with them is the best way to then gain a mastery of them, and
thus be able to learn what commands are best for what situation.
The second thing is to become familiar with the map.  The best way to
start out is to carefully explore the FARWIND town.
Once you are comfortable with the novice lands, you might
want to venture out to the rest of the world.  But, realize that this is not
that easy a task, since most of the world is designed for characters much
more powerful than you.  It is probably a good idea to find someone who has
explored before, who can show you around and point out the dangers.

              Sincerely your mad...

